### TeamForge Phase 9 API Tests (REST Client Format)
### Escrow and Payment Safety (Booking Window, Idempotency, 30-min Auto-Expiry, Closure Refund, Reconciliation)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@superUserToken = Bearer YOUR_SUPERUSER_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@ownerToken = Bearer YOUR_OWNER_TOKEN_HERE
@collabToken = Bearer YOUR_COLLABORATOR_TOKEN_HERE

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. BOOKING WINDOW VALIDATION
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1a. Booking Without Scheduled Date
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Code: BOOKING_OUTSIDE_WINDOW
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/book
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "mentor-profile-1",
  "projectId": "proj-5",
  "projectDescription": "Architecture review without date"
}

###

### 1b. Booking In The Past
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Code: BOOKING_OUTSIDE_WINDOW
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/book
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "mentor-profile-1",
  "projectId": "proj-5",
  "projectDescription": "Past date booking attempt",
  "scheduledAt": "2020-01-01T10:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### 1c. Booking After Project Due Date
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Code: BOOKING_OUTSIDE_WINDOW
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/book
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "mentor-profile-1",
  "projectId": "proj-1",
  "projectDescription": "Booking after project due date",
  "scheduledAt": "2028-05-01T12:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### 1d. Valid Booking Inside Window
# Expected Status: 201 Created
# Returns: { session: { id, status: "payment_pending", scheduledAt, ... }, paymentIntent: { id, upiUri, ... } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/book
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "mentor-profile-1",
  "projectId": "proj-5",
  "projectDescription": "Deliverables review within window",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-03-15T14:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. PAYMENT CONFIRMATION & IDEMPOTENCY
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2a. First Payment Confirmation with Idempotency-Key
# Replace SESSION_ID with the session id returned in step 1d
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Returns: { success: true, session: { status: "escrow_funded" }, escrow: { ... } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/SESSION_ID/confirm-payment
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
Idempotency-Key: e9a2c314-5b6d-4e8f-9a1c-7d3e5f2b8a01
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 2b. Repeat Payment with SAME Idempotency-Key (Idempotency Safe)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Invariant: Never charges twice, returns original cached payment result
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/SESSION_ID/confirm-payment
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
Idempotency-Key: e9a2c314-5b6d-4e8f-9a1c-7d3e5f2b8a01
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 2c. Pay on Alias Route with SAME Idempotency-Key
# Expected Status: 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/SESSION_ID/pay
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
Idempotency-Key: e9a2c314-5b6d-4e8f-9a1c-7d3e5f2b8a01
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 2d. Payment with DIFFERENT Idempotency-Key on Already Paid Session
# Expected Status: 409 Conflict
# Expected Code: ALREADY_PAID
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/SESSION_ID/confirm-payment
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
Idempotency-Key: b7c8d9e0-1f2a-3b4c-5d6e-7f8a9b0c1d2e
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. PAYMENT EXPIRY JOB (30-MIN WINDOW) IN HOURLY TICK
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3a. Super User Manually Triggers Hourly Tick
# Expected Status: 202 Accepted
# Returns: { runId: "..." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/tick
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
x-user-id: u-superuser

###

### 3b. Verify expirePendingPayments Job in Run Log
# Replace RUN_ID with runId returned from tick
# Expected Status: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/runs/RUN_ID
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
x-user-id: u-admin

###

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. ESCROW RECONCILIATION
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4a. Collaborator Access to Escrow Reconciliation (Forbidden)
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/escrow/reconcile
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2

###

### 4b. Admin Escrow Reconciliation
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Verifies Invariant: totalOwnerPaid === totalMentorPayout + totalPlatformFee + totalRefunds + totalInEscrow
# Returns: { ok: true, totalSessions, reconciledCount, totals: { ... }, mismatches: [] }
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/escrow/reconcile
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
x-user-id: u-admin

###

### 4c. Super User Escrow Reconciliation
# Expected Status: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/escrow/reconcile
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
x-user-id: u-superuser
